# Deploy preference

- When the user says **sync** (or wants the site updated), run `scripts/deploy-ecs.ps1` to ECS directly. Do **not** rely on GitHub Actions.
- Do **not** `git push` unless the user explicitly says **push** (or asks to sync remote git).
- Local commits are fine when the user asks to commit; push is separate and opt-in.
